1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,350
WAOS: design a space mission the way NASA does.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,058
Pick a contract and split up four roles.

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:10,667
Every choice changes mass, power, cost and data.

4
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:16,145
Then you fly it with real physics:
gravity, eclipses and ground stations.

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,093
Anomalies are decided as a team.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,311
All the way to the Artemis lunar orbit.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:27,637
And the debrief tells you why it worked,
and which NASA mission it resembles.

